# Git worktree (agents)

Before editing or committing on a task:

1. `git worktree add .worktrees/<slug>/ -b feat/<topic> origin/main` from the repo that has `.git`, or reuse `.worktrees/<slug>/` on your branch. Stay **under** `./.worktrees/` inside this repo.
2. Move the **workspace / agent root** to that folder (Cursor: move agent to root → that path). All edits and commits happen there.

Do not implement only at the main clone root while “using a branch” elsewhere. See root **AGENTS.md** for full policy.
